From dbd14ca58f619e4a8639b47074d4c50fc1268188 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 26 Nov 2023 20:32:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-334] preboot: remove legacy preboot build

Legacy baremetal preboot is not used anymore. the sources and
makefile code is removed.
Some of Preboot's code is used in erom recovery, preboot object was
linked directly into erom. Instead the relevant code was moved to
erom recovery source file.

Change-Id: I03617ae78df7fbd3d46bb89dbcf4886dffdf4ed9
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

